    "section": "24. Core Abilities",
    "ruleNumber": "24.11",
    "summary": "[EXTRA ATTACKS]. When the unit fights, each model carrying these weapons selects all of them during Select Weapons. It also picks one ordinary melee weapon if available. A unit equipped solely with [Extra Attacks] weapons can skip the ordinary melee pick. Resolve attacks from every weapon picked.",
